   "id": "s0",
   "title": "Write 15° as 30°/2",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\cos15^\\circ=\\cos\\dfrac{30^\\circ}2=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1+\\cos30^\\circ}2}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{The positive root is right, because 15° is}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{in quadrant I.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
